  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 229 (tools/dungeongen, spec tools/dungeongen/plans.json). The boss order is the usual clear order, the packs are the spawn clusters nearest each boss; walls, doors, stairs and events are unknown to it. Not mapped, not live-checked: do the GM-invisible mapping walk and correct the route before the first run (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0); dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "A wait_for on a door a lever or key opens needs timeout_s 60 (the default): a linked door can open 30 s after the use.",
    "Raid plan: 10 players, the tank/healer/dps split is a placeholder. dungeon_run has no raid driver yet; the file is data for the raid leader.",
    "Needs: Seal of Ascension (item 12344), the vanilla key to the upper spire door (unverified for Turtle)",
    "Needs: Pyroguard Emberseer: the seven runes (GO_EMBERSEER_RUNE01-07) and his cage (GO_EMBERSEER_IN/OUT); Solakar Flamewreath and the Rookery eggs (GO_ROOKERY_EGG)",
    "Needs: Gyth (10339) has no spawn row: summoned in Rend's arena (GO_GYTH_ENTRY/COMBAT/EXIT_DOOR); Rend Blackhand is then fought",
    "Needs: Drakkisath's door and the Father Flame (GO_FATHER_FLAME)",
    "Upper half of map 229 (a box on x). The party enters by teleport inside: the instance has one entrance trigger (1468) which leads to LBRS. Lord Valthalak (16042) is Turtle's addition."
  ],
